nd cutting-edge AI quickly, efficiently and everywhere. Equinix, Inc. was established on June 22, 1998 and incorporated in Delaware. Equinix, Inc. is based in Redwood City, United States.","ceo_bio":"Ms. Adaire Rita Fox-Martin | President, CEO & Director | Age 61 | Compensation: $1.2M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 13K people. Revenue per employee of $672K ranks in the bottom quartile among Real Estate peers, with revenue growing 14%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $36K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 2\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (7/10).","financial_summary":["Equinix, Inc. is a large-cap real estate business with a $104.3B market cap on $9.2B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +8% over the past three years and +13% annually across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 5% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $400M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage runs at 3.5\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 1.7%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 335% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":3.3461566037039527},{"text":"Payout ratio looks stretched \u2014 the dividend\u2019s own margin of safety is thin","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $11.8M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Interest-rate sensitivity and tenant-credit risk \u2014 cap rates and refinancing costs move faster than the 10-year leases can absorb.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Remote work structural vacancy \u2014 the post-pandemic shift to hybrid work has permanently impaired demand for urban office space across most markets.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Climate and insurance cost escalation \u2014 rising premiums and coverage withdrawals in flood/fire zones are repricing assets that the market once treated as perpetuities.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["11 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Among the least levered in Real Estate \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"How Are Record Bookings Pushing EQIX (NASDAQ:EQIX) to Raise Guidance a Third Time?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/infrastructure-and-real-estate/how-are-record-bookings-pushing-eqix-nasdaqeqix-to-raise-guidance-a-third-time","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794575160.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.128,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["guidance"]},{"title":"How Investors Are Reacting To Equinix (EQIX) Green Bond Offering","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/real-estate/nasdaq-eqix/equinix/news/how-investors-are-reacting-to-equinix-eqix-green-bond-offeri","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794561775.432,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.836,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Is Equinix (EQIX) Reasonable With Cash Flow Riding On Expansion?","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/equinix-eqix-reasonable-cash